            "detailed_description": "Enter The Glade: A beautiful forest with only one issue - it's overrun by giant spiders! You must fight to survive increasing waves of attacking spiders in this exhilarating first-person survival shooter. Armed with a pistol, you’ll earn points for defeating enemies that you can use for weapon upgrades like laser guns and grenades. You might even get over your fear of spiders. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures: <br />\r\n<br />\r\n• Use multiple weapons with intuitive hand controls <br />\r\n• Earn points to upgrade your guns, buy ammo and grenades <br />\r\n• Endless gameplay",
            "about_the_game": "Enter The Glade: A beautiful forest with only one issue - it's overrun by giant spiders! You must fight to survive increasing waves of attacking spiders in this exhilarating first-person survival shooter. Armed with a pistol, you’ll earn points for defeating enemies that you can use for weapon upgrades like laser guns and grenades. You might even get over your fear of spiders. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures: <br />\r\n<br />\r\n• Use multiple weapons with intuitive hand controls <br />\r\n• Earn points to upgrade your guns, buy ammo and grenades <br />\r\n• Endless gameplay",
