                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The gun position doesn't line up with the controller, its like the game was designed to be played with some kind of gun attachment where you hold the gun from a handle sticking out perpendicular to the bottom of the controller.  This makes aiming very difficult.\n\nThe game doesn't appear to have any sort of save-point mechanism, you play until you die then start back from the very beginning.\n\nI saw the positive reviews and thought I would give it a shot, despite the video/screenshots (I care more about gameplay then graphics) but alas it doesn't have any meaningful gameplay elements that would keep me coming back more than the 9 minutes I spent figuring out how to play.",
